'''Gehenbar hive''' was a notable [[Geonosian hive]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> and a major [[city]]<ref name="AEYNTKUE">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know, Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> on the [[planet]] [[Geonosis]]. It wielded huge influence over the [[Politics|political system]] of the world's [[Geonosian]] [[species]],<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> which included ten prime hives.<ref name="Separatists">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Separatists}}</ref> All bar [[Klik-Klak|one]] of the Geonosians on Geonosis were [[Death|wiped out]] when the [[Galactic Empire]] [[Sterilization of Geonosis|sterilized]] the planet<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> around [[9 BBY]].<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
In the current ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], Gehenbar hive was first mentioned in the [[2015]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''.<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> The [[Gehenbar hive/Legends|hive]] originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it was mentioned in ''[[Geonosis and the Outer Rim Worlds]]'', a [[2004]] supplement for the ''[[Star Wars Roleplaying Game]]'' produced by [[Wizards of the Coast]].<ref name="GATORW">''[[Geonosis and the Outer Rim Worlds]]''</ref>

